"Implementation of the boundary integral operator. See :meth:`pybamm."
"SpatialMethod.boundary_integral`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pybamm/spatial_methods/scikit_finite_element.py:docstring
#: of
#: pybamm.spatial_methods.scikit_finite_element.ScikitFiniteElement.boundary_integral_vector:1
msgid ""
"A node in the expression tree representing an integral operator over the "
"boundary of a domain"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pybamm/spatial_methods/scikit_finite_element.py:docstring
#: of
#: pybamm.spatial_methods.scikit_finite_element.ScikitFiniteElement.boundary_integral_vector:4
msgid ""
"I = \\int_{\\partial a}\\!f(u)\\,du,\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pybamm/spatial_methods/scikit_finite_element.py:docstring
#: of
#: pybamm.spatial_methods.scikit_finite_element.ScikitFiniteElement.boundary_integral_vector:7
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\partial a` is the boundary of the domain, and :math:"
"`u\\in\\text{domain boundary}`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pybamm/spatial_methods/scikit_finite_element.py:docstring
#: of
#: pybamm.spatial_methods.scikit_finite_element.ScikitFiniteElement.boundary_integral_vector:10
msgid "The domain(s) of the variable in the integrand"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pybamm/spatial_methods/scikit_finite_element.py:docstring
#: of
#: pybamm.spatial_methods.scikit_finite_element.ScikitFiniteElement.boundary_integral_vector:12
msgid ""
"The region of the boundary over which to integrate. If region is `entire` "
"the integration is carried out over the entire boundary. If region is "
"`negative tab` or `positive tab` then the integration is only carried out "
"over the appropriate part of the boundary corresponding to the tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pybamm/spatial_methods/scikit_finite_element.py:docstring
